      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "REG (8) looks close to another win after hitting the frame in a neck second (25.69) in a T3 RSTW at this track. Although beaten ran one of the quickest times on the card last start. Deserves serious consideration. FRED'S FAST (7) goes very well over this track and trip including two wins. Comes off a (25.71) win last time, scoring by 0.8 lengths in a Bottom Up - Restricted Win over 450m at this track. With even luck and a clean start should be around the money. ASTON MALI (1) put in a much better performance last start when in the placings at Geelong behind Aston Exclusive (26.18) in a Rank Limit - Grade 5. Led around the bend before fighting on well and should give a sight. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Leading player again. CHRISTMAS (2) is worth consideration.",
